\caption{C2 mechanism ladder at $-20$~dB, $480$ paired trials per rung
sharing scenes, RIS codes, Jones states, gains and noise realization. Each
rung adds one Phase~I mechanism ahead of the same Phase~II route;
intervals are exact Clopper--Pearson. The operating-region block, in which
every rung above the baseline sits at one trial in $480$, is
supplementary.}
\label{tab:c2_ladder}
\centering
\footnotesize
\setlength{\tabcolsep}{3.4pt}
\begin{tabular}{lccc}
\toprule
